msgstr "ຄູ່ຮ່ວມທຸລະກິດພິເສດ"

#. module: theme_buzzy
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_buzzy.s_showcase
msgid ""
"Features <span class=\"o_text_highlight o_translate_inline "
"o_text_highlight_scribble_3 o_text_highlight_fill\" style=\"--text-highlight-"
"color: var(--o-color-3);\">showcase</span>"
msgstr ""
"ການສະແດງ <span class=\"o_text_highlight o_translate_inline "
"o_text_highlight_scribble_3 o_text_highlight_fill\" style=\"--text-highlight-"
"color: var(--o-color-3);\">ຄຸນສົມບັດເດັ່ນ</span>"

#. module: theme_buzzy
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:theme_buzzy.field_theme_utils__id
msgid "ID"
msgstr "ລະຫັດ"

#. module: theme_buzzy
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_theme_buzzy
msgid ""
"Illustrative banner opens onto a discovery exploration block, product "
"showcase, key-benefit grids, and accordion-with-image FAQ, with shaped "
"containers and organic blob motifs throughout and recurring scribble-and-"
"marker highlights on key heading words. Content-heavy and benefit-driven, "
"leaning illustrative rather than photo-led / suited for corporate services, "
"technology companies, and SaaS-style product marketing sites"
msgstr ""
"ປ້າຍໂຄສະນາແບບຮູບແຕ້ມປະກອບ ເປີດໄປສູ່ບລັອກການສຳຫຼວດຄົ້ນຫາ, ການສະແດງສິນຄ້າ, ຕາຕະລາງຜົນປະໂຫຍດຫຼັ"
"ກ, ແລະ ຄຳຖາມທີ່ພົບເລື້ອຍ (FAQ) ແບບຫຍໍ້-ຂະຫຍາຍພ້ອມຮູບພາບ, ໂດຍມີກອບຮູບຊົງ ແລະ ລວດລາຍຮູບຊົງທຳມ"
"ະຊາດຕະຫຼອດທັງໜ້າ ພ້ອມທັງການເນັ້ນຂໍ້ຄວາມຫົວຂໍ້ຫຼັກດ້ວຍເສັ້ນຂີດຂຽນ ແລະ ໄຮໄລ້. ເນັ້ນໜັກດ້ານເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ ຈຸດ"
"ເດັ່ນຂອງຜົນປະໂຫຍດ, ໂດຍເນັ້ນໃສ່ຮູບພາບປະກອບຫຼາຍກວ່າຮູບຖ່າຍ / ເໝາະສຳລັບການບໍລິການຂອງອົງກອນ, ບໍລິສັ"
"ດເຕັກໂນໂລຊີ, ແລະ ເວັບໄຊການຕະຫຼາດຜະລິດຕະພັນແບບ SaaS"

#. module: theme_buzzy
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_buzzy.s_cta_box
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "ຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມເຕີມ"

#. module: theme_buzzy
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_buzzy.s_cta_box
msgid "Looking for a place to work ? We got you covered<br/><br/>"
msgstr "ກຳລັງຊອກຫາບ່ອນເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ບໍ? ພວກເຮົາພ້ອມໃຫ້ບໍລິການທ່ານສະເໝີ<br/><br/>"

#. module: theme_buzzy
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_buzzy.s_key_benefits
msgid ""
"Our team provides continuous support, ensuring your projects run smoothly "
"and challenges are addressed promptly."
msgstr ""
"ທີມງານຂອງພວກເຮົາໃຫ້ການຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ, ເພື່ອຮັບປະກັນໃຫ້ໂຄງການຂອງທ່ານດຳເນີນໄປຢ່າງສະດວກ ແລ"
"ະ ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາຕ່າງໆໄດ້ຢ່າງທັນການ."

#. module: theme_buzzy
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_buzzy.s_key_benefits
msgid "Strategic Solutions"
msgstr "ວິທີແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາແບບຍຸດທະສາດ"

#. module: theme_buzzy
#: model:ir.model,name:theme_buzzy.model_theme_utils
msgid "Theme Utils"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືຊ່ວຍຈັດການຊຸດຮູບແບບ"

#. module: theme_buzzy
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_buzzy.s_accordion_image
msgid ""
"Top <span class=\"o_text_highlight o_translate_inline "
"o_text_highlight_scribble_4 o_text_highlight_fill\" style=\"--text-highlight-"
"color: var(--o-color-3);\">questions</span> answered"
msgstr ""
"ຕອບທຸກ <span class=\"o_text_highlight o_translate_inline "
"o_text_highlight_scribble_4 o_text_highlight_fill\" style=\"--text-highlight-"
"color: var(--o-color-3);\">ຄຳຖາມ</span> ຍອດນິຍົມ"

#. module: theme_buzzy
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_buzzy.s_banner
msgid ""
"Unleash your <strong><span class=\"o_text_highlight o_translate_inline "
"o_text_highlight_scribble_3 o_text_highlight_fill\" style=\"--text-highlight-"
"color: var(--o-color-3);\">potential</span>.</strong>"
msgstr ""
"ປົດປ່ອຍ <strong><span class=\"o_text_highlight o_translate_inline "
"o_text_highlight_scribble_3 o_text_highlight_fill\" style=\"--text-highlight-"
"color: var(--o-color-3);\">ທ່າແຮງບົ່ມຊ້ອນ</span> ຂອງທ່ານ.</strong>"

#. module: theme_buzzy
#: model_terms:theme.ir.ui.view,arch:theme_buzzy.s_key_benefits
msgid ""
"We offer tailored strategies that align with your business goals, driving "
"growth and maximizing efficiency."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາສະເໜີຍຸດທະສາດທີ່ເໝາະສົມ ເຊິ່ງສອດຄ່ອງກັບເປົ້າໝາຍທຸລະກິດຂອງທ່ານ, ເພື່ອຊຸກຍູ້ການເຕີບໂຕ ແລະ ສ້າງ"
"ປະສິດທິພາບສູງສຸດ."
